{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model with multiprofile and avgpool aggregation, using pca_n2000 (RNA) and resnet50 (image) encoders with concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6186 and F1 of 0.6103 exceed prior multimodal baselines, suggesting multiprofile and avgpool aggregation may improve performance. However, the specific contribution of each design choice remains uncertain, and further experiments are needed to isolate their individual effects compared to other aggregation methods."
}

